# Everything in this repo is consumed by Linux (bash, mkarchiso, Calamares,
# systemd, podman) - CRLF line endings break `set -euo pipefail`, shebangs,
# and unit files outright. Force LF on checkout regardless of the local
# core.autocrlf setting (Git for Windows defaults it to true).
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
*.bin binary
*.svgz binary
